// The compiler's version
// ======================
// Read by `hive version` and by `hive container`, which pins the compiler its
// Dockerfile downloads.
//
// Tagging rewrites the line below before anything is compiled, so what is
// committed is a floor rather than a contract — see .github/workflows/build.yml.
// It is source rather than something read from the environment because
// `./selfhost` diffs two builds of one tree, and they have to agree.

// The release this compiler is, spelled the way the tag is.
func current(): Str {
	return "v0.1.9"
}
